      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wonder why cloth component is disabled in the avatar menu?\n\nIf vrchat doesn't remove the component from the menu, but disables it in the menu, it will cause people to crash. Disabling in the unity editor will cause unity to crash as well. This is a unity known problem since 5.6.0f3 and was patched in 2017.3.0f3.\n\nhttps://issuetracker.unity3d.com/issues/disabling-cloth-component-on-prefab-crashes-the-editor-at-unity-cloth-setenabled",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
